# A Seat at the Table
# Dialogic source. Line signals drive the cinematic layout and save checkpoints.
label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
Let me stir.
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
The pot is heavy.
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
Then hold the handle. I can still stir.
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
We make a convincing kitchen team.
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
A team requires you to listen sometimes.
label line_5
[signal arg="line:5:Narrator:protected"]
You hold the handle. She seasons the soup. Dinner tastes like both of you.
